What:		/sys/touchpanel/oplus_backlight
Date:		October 2026
Description:
		ColorOS brightness compatibility interface, enabled by
		CONFIG_OPLUS_BACKLIGHT_NODE. Reads report the requested brightness
		of panel0-backlight scaled to 0..8191, not measured panel luminance.

		Writes accept unsigned decimal integers, optionally followed by
		".0" and a newline. Values above 8191 are clamped to 8191.
		The value is scaled to the native maximum; a nonzero input maps
		to at least one native brightness step. Zero requests zero.

		Writes use the backlight core's normal update path and return
		its error if the update fails. Reads and writes return ENODEV
		when panel0-backlight is absent, or EINVAL for an invalid native
		maximum. Invalid input also returns EINVAL.
